        <mxCell id="legendtext" value="Release path (numbered)&#10;1  image pushed to ECR as :latest&#10;2  EventBridge starts CodePipeline&#10;3  CodeDeploy reads taskdef + appspec&#10;4  blue/green cutover on the ALB&#10;&#10;Application Load Balancer&#10;internet-facing, one node per AZ&#10;:80 production listener&#10;:8080 test listener&#10;blue and green target groups&#10;&#10;Five subnet tiers, two AZs&#10;ALB, ECS, cache, RDS Proxy, RDS.&#10;Each tier has its own subnets and&#10;its own security group, so a&#10;compromise in one tier cannot&#10;reach another except on the single&#10;port that tier is allowed to use.&#10;&#10;No NAT gateway&#10;Private subnets have no default&#10;route. AWS APIs are reached over&#10;six interface endpoints, and S3&#10;(ECR layers) over a gateway&#10;endpoint.&#10;&#10;Credentials&#10;RDS generates and rotates the&#10;master password in Secrets&#10;Manager every 7 days. No password&#10;appears in a template, a change&#10;set or a task definition.&#10;&#10;Auto scaling&#10;1 to 4 tasks, CPU target 60%.&#10;&#10;Line styles&#10;solid  = request path&#10;dashed = replication or control" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
